{"time": 1755441042, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28276102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对了，安安是什么职介，caster吗”"}
{"time": 1755441253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "887455821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，很失望吗？\"眼神涣散，借着飞鸟的视觉继续侦查附近，伸出一只手，\"请来我身边，我的皇后...\""}
{"time": 1755441281, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1422264210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那到也没有...安安很可爱，我很喜欢”"}
