{"time": 1755442674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474595448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以给我介绍一下吗..安安”"}
{"time": 1755442750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162970918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我的皇后...能和我一起吗？\"被抱在怀里，低头向皇后示意，\"这是我的御主亲。\"微微偏着头看着天宫露，\"嗯?皇后就是皇后哦?\""}
{"time": 1755442882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663042449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“皇后大人好”给皇后打个招呼“今后拜托你们了”"}
{"time": 1755442942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668815008", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“嗯↑哼↓，希望你们的情绪和甜品足够有价值”"}
{"time": 1755443199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803165252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"皇后或许比我更适合当从者啦，要不要也起一个名字?嗯...玛丽皇后?\"脆生生地开口，带着小孩子的娇气，\"御主亲怎么想的?\""}
{"time": 1755443266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108171743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...都听安安的”"}
{"time": 1755443429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175168736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"皇后又是怎么想的?\"带着笑容看向皇后，朝她招招手，\"抱..\""}
