{"time": 1755445627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184538959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=750024398]“只保留传送功能，倒是能做到”她轻抚你的镯子“不过要些时间”"}
{"time": 1755445733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099589943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，也好，顺便还能探查一下各地的灵脉等级”"}
{"time": 1755445780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774476669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这次出来天宫家还是给了我蛮多钱的，安安有什么想要的吗”"}
{"time": 1755445811, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178405375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，那玛丽皇后就先一边做着复现，一边和我们一起逛街吧？\"笑眯眯开口，\"御亲，我的鸟儿已经去了东边，现在要一起去西边吗？\"皱起眉，\"虽然我很讨厌，罗马。\""}
{"time": 1755445886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314652510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啊...”仔细端详一下安安“安安小小的，好可爱啊”"}
{"time": 1755445895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120594171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（别说做复现这种邪恶的话）"}
{"time": 1755445897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749360895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "牵起安安的手"}
{"time": 1755445938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193250778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“去商业区怎么样...那里应该有卖好多东西”"}
{"time": 1755446067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "633560897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1314652510]\"刚刚不是还在嫌弃我太矮了吗？\"歪着脑袋，另一只手牵着皇后，\"那就走吧?\"低着脑袋\"安安没有什么想要的...我只想...好的读者...读着永远幸福的故事...所以，御亲，你的愿望...我会努力。\""}
{"time": 1755446225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1048871796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我自己长得也不高啊，不过这就是安安的愿望吗...会赢的，如果我和安安一起的话”"}
{"time": 1755446381, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1177775001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...总觉得御亲比我还天真呢？\"眨着眼睛，\"嗯...不过我不讨厌呢，御亲的这份天真，请一直一直...拥有着...\""}
{"time": 1755446454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095294386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安安叫我小露或者露儿吧，露亲也行”"}
