{"time": 1755673775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623797603", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "（自然是你的本体）"}
{"time": 1755673886, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848490928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=239208932]“嗯，你可以叫我花火~也可以叫我花火大人~”她微微笑着"}
{"time": 1755673918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721108618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"放弃伪装，变回最开始的样子，\"...花火大人看得见我吗？\""}
{"time": 1755673931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "207091255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“花火大人的眼神蛮不错的样子哎”"}
{"time": 1755674146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1753163010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1721108618]“哎呀，当然当然。要不是花火大人还有要事在身，同为伪装扮演爱好者，我都想请你们吃小蛋糕了”"}
{"time": 1755674227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704992432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“花火大人有什么要事，需要我们帮忙吗，安安挺喜欢吃蛋糕的”"}
{"time": 1755674293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072334577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"点点头，\"有蛋糕吃...爱丽丝可以帮忙。\""}
{"time": 1755674346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730903487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "“不用不用，幕后工作当然只能是我全权负责啦”花火摇了摇手指“不过你们运气不错~正好找过来了。虽然对你们来说没什么用，但是你们可以把人家刚挂上的面具拿走~”"}
{"time": 1755674592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42935823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“花火大人人好好，谢谢你了，等你忙完了来找我，我带你和安安去吃蛋糕去”"}
{"time": 1755674646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477862572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=730903487]\"嗯...\"看着她，感觉有些奇怪的违和感，走上前伸出手递给她马卡龙，\"幕后...花火大人，是ruler吗？\""}
{"time": 1755674792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023582689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "3625185457"}, "sender": {"id": "3625185457", "name": "多拉贡"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1477862572]“那是另一个我啦。不过抛开身份只论个体的话……也不对，我只是观察者啦”*她接过你的马卡龙放进嘴里"}
{"time": 1755674879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644256001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "964141319", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "取下那个面具端详一下"}
